1. Definitions
   "Software" means the source code, configuration files, documentation and
   pre-trained model weights distributed in this repository
   (https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05550, "Subject-Relative Micro-Motion and
   Sleep Dynamics for Near-Infrared Video Sleep Staging", NeurIPS 2026).
   "Non-Commercial Academic Use" means use by individuals or organizations
   for teaching, academic research, scholarly publication, or personal
   experimentation, where no direct or indirect commercial advantage or
   monetary compensation is sought.

