3. Data
   This license does not cover the Korea Video Sleep Study (KVSS) dataset.
   KVSS is distributed separately by AI Hub (https://aihub.or.kr) under its
   own terms and requires a data-use approval; no video, label, or derived
   per-subject data is distributed with the Software.

